WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:02,950
Aunt Zhou, I'm coming. Where do you live?

2
00:00:02,950 --> 00:00:06,170
I also live on the fifteenth floor 1501

3
00:00:06,170 --> 00:00:11,800
We are neighbors. You are the new one. 1502

4
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:14,160
We live so close. If you are short of food and drink in the future,

5
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:17,200
You can tell auntie. If I have more, I will definitely share it with you.

6
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:31,800
Thank you. What do you want to eat today?

7
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:42,560
Mom, give me some food. Eat first.

8
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:46,380
Mom is lying

9
00:00:46,380 --> 00:00:49,540
I'll give it to you after I finish eating the wontons
